# Evaluate

<Aside title="Reserved — coming when continuous Eval ships" data-variant="not">

Evaluate recipes will be added as the continuous Eval runtime ships. Eval is a
`Verifier` implementation (`implementation.kind: eval`), not a separate card
kind; the Verifier spec is authored and its JSON Schema is checked in.

</Aside>

Evaluate capability covers:

- Scoring agent runs against task definitions in CI
- Comparing model outputs against collected production records
- Running `wyrd eval` from the CLI

These how-to pages will be added alongside the continuous Eval runtime. See what runs
today in the [Overview](/overview/).
